COMMENT     The assembly qqTetUrti3.hap1.1 is based on 32x PacBio data and
            Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project
            (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included
            the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation
            with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode, and Hi-C based
            scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was assembled using
            MitoHiFi. Finally, each haplotype assembly was analysed and
            manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds
            confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. This
            genome has been assembled using PacBio and HiC data and phased. The
            result is two curated haplotypes. A large number of repeats is in
            the unlocalised sequences.
